  texts:
    clickCaller: A call! Click the caller to answer.
    readMessage: Read who they want to talk to.
    readMessageDone: Read who they want to talk to. Click to continue.
    callerJack: This blinking light is the caller's line. Now find who they want.
    openBook: Open the phone book.
    findJacks: Find who they want and click their name.
    takeCord: Take a cord.
    plugCaller: Plug one end into the caller's blinking jack.
    plugRecipient: Now plug the other end into the jack you found.
    connected: Connected! You earn money while they talk.
    buyCord: You can afford another cord. Buy it to handle two calls at once.
    mystery: Save up for the mystery upgrade!
    buyProfit: 'More Profit: every call pays more. Buy it to earn faster.'
    buyClients: 'More Clients: more callers at once, and a bigger board.'
